<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Privacy — Toolix</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Toolix privacy policy. Learn how all operations run client-side." />
</head>
<body class="bg-[var(--color-bg)] text-[var(--color-text)] font-sans antialiased">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12 sm:px-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Privacy</h1>
    <section class="space-y-6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Cookie Handling</h2>
      <p>Toolix sets no first-party tracking cookies and uses no third-party behavioral analytics cookies. Only a session cookie may be set by the advertising network for ad delivery; no personal identification is collected.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Advertising Policy</h2>
      <p>Ads are served through an approved network. Viewability is verified via IntersectionObserver (at least 50% visible). Auto-refresh pauses when the user minimizes the tab or is idle, with a maximum 35-second interval.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Content Security Policy</h2>
      <p>All pages include a strict CSP: scripts restricted to self-hosted sources and authorized advertising endpoints; form submissions to external endpoints are blocked; worker scripts allowed only from local blob sources.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Data Isolation</h2>
      <p>Files are loaded using browser FileReader APIs as temporary binary ArrayBuffers. When the tab is closed or refreshed, all file data is purged. No server database stores user inputs.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
